ena a todas as forças no castelo que depositem as armas.","e":"Command all the forces within the castle to lay down their arms.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.886883,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"8ed6877a494b7a58f848ef85a9a4d469","i":"e856fb90ae0d9bb87482efd9b29b3109","r":"4283074:6656810:496:2651664","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4283074","6656810","496"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Deram-nos ordena para destruir uma aldeia, matar todos os homens, mulheres e crianças.","e":"We were ordered to destroy a village, kill every man, woman and child.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.902477,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"42d114d9b51182156044df3c960b6336","i":"59648fc907822b2ac1b1dbac76a0ba4f","r":"3919384:6007062:128:710965","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["3919384","6007062","128"],"w":["leaf",0]}]]},"14e4c0cb":{"m":[[{"t":"Podes continuar irritada comigo, mas eu não fiz isto.","e":"You can keep acting pissed at me, but I didn't do this.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.856538,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"6e8a0f7e35ec956d4133dda0d6fcbf52","i":"028aafa6d2be8d0cec5e4ff5f7de1a6b","r":"5207738:6816958:130:3401825","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5207738","6816958","130"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"O modo como olhou para mim, quis chorar, mas também fiquei irritada.","e":"The way he looked at me, I wanted to cry, but I also got really angry.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.862756,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"2f2ec9046f497e111b2dfd33b2fa6bd6","i":"0aba502e9709cdf8a856b61be1fe337d","r":"5577816:6665877:240:3850546","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5577816","6665877","240"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Já te vi irritada, triste... solitária e feliz.","e":"I've seen you angry, sad, lonely, happy.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.857942,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"6a515e86f45514c477fa612c1d6aa634","i":"4c89656b26ad3f8bedac3d4596551054","r":"4381258:6259148:488:1407202","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4381258","6259148","488"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Ela está muito irritada e não a posso culpar.","e":"She's too annoyed, and I don't blame her.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.792959,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"f092fbd9f0e4e83ca39b41db241f0565","i":"776ce6f44ddf23f33b73c23de4017c25","r":"4574910:6693005:224:1727280","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4574910","6693005","224"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Já não estou irritada consigo pelo que aconteceu.","e":"I'm not angry at you anymore for what happened.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.889398,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"a7d59cb360d5f3b43a72d03704ec9adf","i":"c41063175dccc50c566780333ea59be9","r":"4899778:6481253:247:3069681","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4899778","6481253","247"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Só posso dizer que estava irritada com uma coisa muito diferente.","e":"I can only say I was angry about something quite different.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.919847,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"a73460e56d2b5c9719e169263c8c2eb0","i":"d72096695c577e6597fd6684b0966862","r":"4557968:6693003:827:1699400","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4557968","6693003","827"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Um bando de gente irritada a reclamar da vida.","e":"Bunch of haters complaining about life.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.733771,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"bcfd30ca89e68bd2a030f875708d0680","i":"f5095b046d0e18c571174458e79926ec","r":"4573238:6191532:629:1722301","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4573238","6191532","629"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Este laboratório está a começar a deixar-me muito irritada.","e":"This lab is really beginning to piss me off.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.861288,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"cc4d0e5c1d9996a50995d6977e97f657","i":"b64a2997246b344ecde059327a2c6a2f","r":"4575932:6312845:732:1732873","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4575932","6312845","732"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"A pele arde, estou irritada, tenho fome.","e":"My skin is crawling. I'm irritable. I'm hungry.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.804372,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"474bb4266299583aa6781297fb266f7b","i":"4800f2a6915b0d4f64715ca6e08b4249","r":"4817916:6366804:112:1916866","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4817916","6366804","112"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Fica irritada e adora, ao mesmo tempo.","e":"It pisses her off, and she loves it at the same time.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.770756,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"79a5277e2a7f303d211ef200aa37c377","i":"aedf91c822e8e9876f54f0bee6738cc9","r":"6720442:7016227:1106:5240945","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6720442","7016227","1106"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Estaria impressionada se não estivesse tão irritada.","e":"I'd be impressed if I wasn't so irritated.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.85871,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"80553912d5ce9d4420a992e7c56c6ddc","i":"d0268b2df3f4b9f759bc46cc30eb0ae4","r":"4141526:6349578:197:967869","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4141526","6349578","197"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Ela olhou irritada para a minha cara.","e":"She looked at me angrily.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.827236,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"89ab5d909f67a56e59bf473280668b85","i":"fbb00086a2d1e7b71f